  "change_summary": "Review draft: preserve the legacy category and risk-count behavior while enforcing 70–250 mmHg systolic and 40–150 mmHg diastolic bounds. Escalation wording and ranges require clinician approval before publication. Assign every field to its declared form section. Supersedes engineering review.1; remains unapproved. Complete HTML field and option coverage; preserve radio and multiline controls. Supersedes engineering review.2.",
  "definition": {
    "schema_version": "1.0",
    "tool_type": "calculator",
    "title": "Blood Pressure Risk Assessment",
